#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Nóòdù náà yí padà lẹ́yìn tí a ya ojú-ewé náà, nítorí náà a kò ṣe nǹkan kan. Yẹ̀ ẹ́ wò kí o sì tún gbìyànjú."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Àwọn àṣẹ ẹ̀rọ rẹ kò fàyè gba yíyí àkọsílẹ̀ yìí padà."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Orúkọ: fabric mìíràn ti ń lo orúkọ yìí tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Olùbáṣepọ̀ (Adapter): fabric mìíràn ti ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ibùdó adapter yìí lórí poller yìí tẹ́lẹ̀. Fabric kan fún ibùdó adapter kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "A kò lè fi fabric náà pamọ́."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "A ti fi fabric náà pamọ́."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Ìṣàyẹ̀wò fabric yìí ń lọ lọ́wọ́, nítorí náà a kò pa nǹkan kan rẹ́. Tún gbìyànjú nígbà tí ó bá parí."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "A ti pa fabric náà àti àkójọ rẹ̀ rẹ́. A kò yí ẹ̀rọ Cacti kankan padà, a kò sì kàn sí fabric náà."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "A kò lè pa fabric náà rẹ́."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "A kò yí ìdánimọ̀ nóòdù náà padà."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "A ti sọ ìdánimọ̀ nóòdù náà di tuntun. A ó tún ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ láti ìyípo tó kàn."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Ìso-pọ̀ ẹ̀rọ náà ti lọ sí nóòdù tuntun."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "A kò lè fìdí àbá náà múlẹ̀. Àwọn nóòdù lè ti yí padà láti ìgbà tí a ti ṣe é."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be rejected."
msgstr "A kò lè kọ àbá náà."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal was rejected."
msgstr "A ti kọ àbá náà."

#: fabric_admin.php
#, php-format
msgid "The node mapping was not changed. %s"
msgstr "A kò yí ìso-pọ̀ nóòdù náà padà. %s"

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was not changed."
msgstr "A kò yí ìso-pọ̀ nóòdù náà padà."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node mapping was saved."
msgstr "A ti fi ìso-pọ̀ nóòdù náà pamọ́."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "No device was created. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ kankan. Wo àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device was created and the node mapped to it. Choose the ports to graph on the New Graphs page."
msgstr "A ti ṣẹ̀dá ẹ̀rọ náà, a sì ti so nóòdù náà pọ̀ mọ́ ọn. Yan àwọn ibùdó láti ya àwòrán lórí ojú-ewé New Graphs."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The inventory could not be read for export."
msgstr "A kò lè ka àkójọ náà fún fífi ránṣẹ́ síta."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates and data query file were installed."
msgstr "A ti fi àwọn àdàkọ Fabric àti fáìlì ìbéèrè dátà sori ètò."

#: fabric_health.php
msgid "The Fabric templates were not installed. See the Cacti Objects table and the Cacti log."
msgstr "A kò fi àwọn àdàkọ Fabric sori ètò. Wo tábìlì Cacti Objects àti àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti."

