#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Fabric templates are not installed. Reinstall them from the health page."
msgstr "A kò fi àwọn àdàkọ Fabric sori ètò. Tún fi wọ́n sori ètò láti ojú-ewé ìlera."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "A ti so nóòdù náà pọ̀ mọ́ ẹ̀rọ kan tẹ́lẹ̀."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The node's fabric is not swept by the main poller, so its device could not be polled."
msgstr "Main poller kì í ṣàyẹ̀wò fabric nóòdù náà, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò ẹ̀rọ rẹ̀."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device does not exist."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ náà kò sí."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The device is polled by another poller than the one that sweeps this fabric, so it could not read the fabric cache."
msgstr "Poller mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí èyí tó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò fabric yìí ni ó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò ẹ̀rọ náà, nítorí náà kò lè ka àpamọ́ fabric."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, host name %s, polled by poller %d, with availability checks and SNMP off."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ \"%s\" láti inú àdàkọ ẹ̀rọ %s, orúkọ olùgbàlejò %s, tí poller %d ń ṣàyẹ̀wò, pẹ̀lú àyẹ̀wò wíwà àti SNMP ní ìpa tì."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The %s data query on it, listing the node's ports. It creates no graph and no data source by itself."
msgstr "Ìbéèrè dátà %s lórí rẹ̀, tó ń ṣe àkójọ àwọn ibùdó nóòdù náà. Kò ṣẹ̀dá àwòrán tàbí orísun dátà kankan fúnra rẹ̀."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Fabric plugin for node %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Plugin Fabric ló ṣẹ̀dá rẹ̀ fún nóòdù %s. Àwọn iye rẹ̀ wá láti inú àpamọ́ plugin; orúkọ olùgbàlejò jẹ́ orúkọ tí a yà sọ́tọ̀ tí a kì í kàn sí láéláé."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, spaces, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Orúkọ: lo lẹ́tà, nọ́ńbà, ààyè, àmì ìdádúró, àmì ìlà, tàbí àmì ìlà ìsàlẹ̀ 1 sí 64, kí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú lẹ́tà tàbí nọ́ńbà."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Backend: choose one of the listed backends."
msgstr "Backend: yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn backend tí a tò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: yan ọ̀kan nínú àwọn poller tí a tò sílẹ̀."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Poller: only the main poller can sweep a fabric until remote poller support is added."
msgstr "Poller: main poller nìkan ni ó lè ṣàyẹ̀wò fabric títí tí a ó fi fi àtìlẹyìn poller òkèèrè kún un."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Sweep Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Àlàfo Ìṣàyẹ̀wò: tẹ odidi ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá láti %d sí %d."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
msgid "Adapter: enter the local adapter name as the kernel names it, such as mlx5_0."
msgstr "Adapter: tẹ orúkọ adapter ìbílẹ̀ bí kernel ṣe pè é, bíi mlx5_0."

#: lib/FabricInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Adapter Port: enter the port number of the local adapter, from 1 to %d."
msgstr "Ibùdó Adapter: tẹ nọ́ńbà ibùdó ti adapter ìbílẹ̀, láti 1 sí %d."

