#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "The sweep runs as root. Run the poller as an unprivileged account with read access to the umad devices through a group."
msgstr "Ìgbálẹ̀ náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí root. Ṣiṣẹ́ olùkójọpọ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí àkọọ́lẹ̀ aláìní-àṣẹ-àkànṣe tí ó ní àṣẹ kíkà sí àwọn ẹ̀rọ umad nípasẹ̀ ẹgbẹ́ kan."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool has the setuid or setgid bit. The plugin never needs it."
msgstr "Ohun-èlò àyẹ̀wò kan ní bítì setuid tàbí setgid. Àfikún náà kò nílò rẹ̀ láé."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool or its directory can be written by an account other than its owner, or by the poller account. Whoever can write it chooses what the poller runs."
msgstr "Àkọọ́lẹ̀ mìíràn yàtọ̀ sí olùní rẹ̀, tàbí àkọọ́lẹ̀ olùkójọpọ̀, lè kọ nǹkan sí ohun-èlò àyẹ̀wò kan tàbí àpò-ìwé rẹ̀. Ẹnikẹ́ni tí ó bá lè kọ sí i ló ń pinnu ohun tí olùkójọpọ̀ ń ṣiṣẹ́."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php
msgid "A umad device is readable or writable by every account, so any local user can query the fabric. Restrict it to a group."
msgstr "Gbogbo àkọọ́lẹ̀ ló lè kà tàbí kọ sí ẹ̀rọ umad kan, nítorí náà olùlò agbègbè èyíkéyìí lè béèrè lọ́wọ́ fabric. Dín in kù sí ẹgbẹ́ kan ṣoṣo."

#: lib/PrivilegeProbe.php lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "Unknown warning"
msgstr "Ìkìlọ̀ àìmọ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Diagnostics Tools"
msgstr "Àwọn Ohun-èlò Àyẹ̀wò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directory, on each poller that sweeps a fabric, holding perfquery, ibnetdiscover, and iblinkinfo. The Debian and Ubuntu packages install them in /usr/sbin. No other program is ever run from it."
msgstr "Àpò-ìwé pípé, lórí olùkójọpọ̀ kọ̀ọ̀kan tí ó ń gbá fabric, tí ó ní perfquery, ibnetdiscover, àti iblinkinfo. Àwọn àpò Debian àti Ubuntu máa ń fi wọ́n sí inú /usr/sbin. Kò sí ètò mìíràn tí a ń ṣiṣẹ́ láti inú rẹ̀ láé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Tool Directory"
msgstr "Àpò-ìwé Ohun-èlò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Name Map"
msgstr "Àwòrán Orúkọ Kókó"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to an infiniband-diags node name map file. Names it supplies are shown only; identity is always the node GUID."
msgstr "Ọ̀nà pípé àṣàyàn sí fáìlì àwòrán orúkọ kókó infiniband-diags kan. Àwọn orúkọ tí ó bá pèsè ni a ó fi hàn nìkan; ìdánimọ̀ jẹ́ GUID kókó náà nígbà gbogbo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Datagram Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò-ìparí Datagram"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Milliseconds each management datagram may take before the tools retry it (their -t option)."
msgstr "Iye ìdá-ẹgbẹ̀rún ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí datagram ìṣàkóso kọ̀ọ̀kan lè lò kí àwọn ohun-èlò tó tún un gbìyànjú (àṣàyàn -t wọn)."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Timeout"
msgstr "Àkókò-ìparí Àṣẹ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one tool run may take before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Iye ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìṣiṣẹ́ ohun-èlò kan lè lò kí a tó dá a dúró kí a sì kọ ọ́ sílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìkùnà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one tool run may print. Larger output is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB tí ìṣiṣẹ́ ohun-èlò kan lè tẹ̀ jáde. A máa ń da àbájáde tí ó tóbi jù nù, a sì ń kọ ọ́ sílẹ̀ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìkùnà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Output"
msgstr "Àbájáde Tó Pọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Sweep"
msgstr "Ìgbálẹ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Time Budget"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Àkókò Kókó"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node sweep may spend reading counters. Ports not reached are read in the next cycle."
msgstr "Iye ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìgbálẹ̀ kókó kan lè lò láti ka àwọn olùkà. Àwọn ibùdó tí a kò dé ni a ó kà ní ìyípo tí ó tẹ̀ lé e."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Failed ports after which a node sweep stops for this cycle. A port that does not answer costs several seconds."
msgstr "Iye àwọn ibùdó tí ó kùnà lẹ́yìn èyí tí ìgbálẹ̀ kókó yóò dúró fún ìyípo yìí. Ibùdó tí kò dáhùn máa ń gba ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Failure Budget"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìkùnà Kókó"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Index Down Ports"
msgstr "Kọ Àwọn Ibùdó Tí Ó Wà Ní Ìsàlẹ̀ Sílẹ̀"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, the Fabric Port data query also lists ports that are down and have no remote end, such as unused adapter ports. Cleared, they are left out until they come up."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá sàmì sí i, ìbéèrè dátà Ibùdó Fabric tún máa ń ṣe àtòjọ àwọn ibùdó tí ó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ tí wọn kò sì ní ìpẹ̀kun òkèèrè, gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn ibùdó olùṣàmuṣe tí a kò lò. Tí a bá mú àmì kúrò, a ó fi wọ́n sílẹ̀ títí wọ́n fi padà sí òkè."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Yọ kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Pa Àwọn Tábìlì Àfikún Mọ́ Nígbà Yíyọ Kúrò"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its fabrics, inventory, and samples. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the inventory first from the Fabric Admin page. The fabric is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Nígbà tí a bá sàmì sí i, yíyọ àfikún náà kúrò yóò pa àwọn fabric, àkójọ-ọjà, àti àwọn àpẹẹrẹ rẹ̀ mọ́. Mú àmì kúrò láti jẹ́ kí yíyọkúrò pa wọ́n rẹ́; ṣe ìkójáde àkójọ-ọjà náà lákọ̀ọ́kọ́ láti ojú-ewé Alákòóso Fabric. A kò kan sí fabric náà láé lọ́nà méjèèjì."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "The tool directory must be an absolute path of letters, digits, dots, dashes, underscores, and slashes, with no trailing slash."
msgstr "Àpò-ìwé ohun-èlò gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ ọ̀nà pípé tí ó ní àwọn lẹ́tà, nọ́ńbà, àmì-ìdádúró, ìlà-àárín, ìlà-ìsàlẹ̀, àti ìlà-gbọọrọ, láìsí ìlà-gbọọrọ ní ìpẹ̀kun."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
