msgstr "Kì í ṣe root ni ó ni ohun-èlò àyẹ̀wò kan."

#: lib/ToolDirectory.php
msgid "A diagnostics tool can be written by its group or by others."
msgstr "Ẹgbẹ́ rẹ̀ tàbí àwọn mìíràn lè kọ nǹkan sí ohun-èlò àyẹ̀wò kan."

